.\" Manpage for Vltimate CV Scraper
.TH VLTIMATE-CV-SCRAPER 1 "12 August 2026" "v2.0" "Vltimate CV Scraper Manual"
.SH NAME
vltimate-cv-scraper \- Technical Intelligence Harvester, ATS Resume Generator & Encryption Vault Engine
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B harvest_cv.sh
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Vltimate CV Scraper
is an automated, privacy-conscious technical intelligence harvester and ATS resume engine. It scans local system architecture, shell command history, git configurations, and remote GitHub repositories to build an unformatted master knowledge base (\fBraw_technical_profile.md\fR) and generate ATS-optimized single-column HTML resumes (\fBcv_en.html\fR and \fBcv_pl.html\fR) and headless PDF exports (\fBcv_en.pdf\fR and \fBcv_pl.pdf\fR).

It supports AES-256 and GPG encryption, job description tailoring, visual experience diff tracking, persistent credential management, and autonomous private cloud synchronization on GitHub.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display command usage and options summary.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-tailor " \fI<FILE_OR_URL>\fR"
Tailor resume summary, keyword badges, and experience bullet points specifically to a job description text file or web URL.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-pdf
Force immediate headless PDF compilation using Google Chrome.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-diff
Generate a visual experience diff log (\fBharvest_diff.log\fR) comparing current harvested data against previous runs.
.TP
.BR \-e ", " \-\-encrypt-mode " \fI<aes|gpg>\fR"
Select encryption engine: \fBaes\fR (OpenSSL AES-256-CBC, default) or \fBgpg\fR (GPG key encryption).
.TP
.BR \-\-gui
Open interactive customization GUI in Google Chrome to set default PDF themes and RODO options.
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config
Reconfigure persistent GitHub credentials and private cloud sync settings (\fB.vltimate_config.env\fR).

.SH FILES
.TP
.I .vltimate_config.env
Local configuration file storing GitHub credentials and private vault settings (strictly gitignored).
.TP
.I .pdf_customization.json
Saved PDF rendering preferences (theme, language, paper size, RODO options).
.TP
.I raw_technical_profile.md
Master technical knowledge base (gitignored plain text, packed in encrypted archive).
.TP
.I personal_data.tar.gz.enc
AES-256 / GPG encrypted personal profile archive.
.TP
.I harvest_diff.log
Visual experience diff tracker log.

